OL,3,GNEWSAHeritage group considers plans to
OL,4,Aprotect landmark
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnglish Heritage is considering further
OL,7,Fmeasures to prevent damage to the mound
OL,8,Funder Clifford's Tower caused by people
OL,9,Fclimbing up the York landmark.
OL,11,FStaff have been verbally abused for
OL,12,Fasking people to behave more
OL,13,Frespectfully around the monument, which
OL,14,Fwas the site of a massacre of Jewish
OL,15,Fresidents in the city in 1190,
OL,16,Faccording to a spokesperson for the
OL,17,Forganisation.
OL,19,FThey said extra security had been
OL,20,Fbrought in at weekends and during the
OL,21,Fschool holidays to try to stop people
OL,22,Ffrom damaging the site.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
